  "notes": "Dark zinc-scale IDE look (Tailwind zinc + indigo-500 primary). Three-tier darkness: rail #0a0a0b, sidebar #141416, main #18181b, cards #1c1c1f with 1px #2a2a2e borders and 8px radii. Colour is reserved for semantics: HTTP method pills (POST amber, GET emerald, GQL violet), git status letters M/A, orange active Git rail icon and orange Commit button, indigo Send/New. Active tabs use an indigo underline; tabs with content show a small blue dot. Git panel mimics VS Code source control (Staged/Changes cards, stage/unstage +/− icons, branch card with '2 ahead', Pull/Push). Response pane empty state uses a line rocket icon. A 'Tip' callout overlaps the response tab strip (layout glitch at 1440px). Request tab strip overflows behind the New button."
